<div id="A8.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A8.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Tab. <a href="#A8.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ H.1 Forgetting mitigation methods sequential tuning tables ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, Tab. <a href="#A8.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ H.1 Forgetting mitigation methods sequential tuning tables ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, Tab. <a href="#A8.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ H.1 Forgetting mitigation methods sequential tuning tables ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, and Tab. <a href="#A8.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ H.1 Forgetting mitigation methods sequential tuning tables ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> are detailed sequential tuning tables for forgetting mitigation approaches tested in the paper, i.e., LoRA, LwF <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib30" title="" class="ltx_ref">Li &amp; Hoiem, 2017</a>)</cite>, WiSE-FT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib69" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wortsman et al., 2022</a>)</cite>, and MoE.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A8.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">H.2 </span>Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-OneVision</h3>

<div id="A8.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A8.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We include the detailed task performances for sequential fine-tuning experiments on LLaVA-OneVision here.
Tab. <a href="#A8.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ H.2 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-OneVision ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, Tab. <a href="#A8.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ H.2 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-OneVision ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>, Tab. <a href="#A8.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ H.2 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-OneVision ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>,
Tab. <a href="#A8.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ H.2 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-OneVision ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>,
Tab. <a href="#A8.T14" title="Table 14 ‣ H.2 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-OneVision ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>,
Tab. <a href="#A8.T15" title="Table 15 ‣ H.2 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-OneVision ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>,
Tab. <a href="#A8.T16" title="Table 16 ‣ H.2 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-OneVision ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>, and Tab. <a href="#A8.T17" title="Table 17 ‣ H.2 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-OneVision ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a> are detailed performance tables of sequentially fine-tuning the Full model, Vision Encoder, Projector, LLM, SA projection layers in LLM, SA Proj. (QKV), MLP layers in LLM, MLP (Gate&amp;Up), respectively.</p>
</div>
