<section id="A8.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">H.3 </span>Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-NeXT (LLaMA 3)</h3>

<div id="A8.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A8.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We include the detailed task performances for sequential fine-tuning experiments on LLaVA-NeXT (LLaMA 3) here.
Tab. <a href="#A8.T18" title="Table 18 ‣ H.3 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-NeXT (LLaMA 3) ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>, Tab. <a href="#A8.T19" title="Table 19 ‣ H.3 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-NeXT (LLaMA 3) ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a>, Tab. <a href="#A8.T20" title="Table 20 ‣ H.3 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-NeXT (LLaMA 3) ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a>,
Tab. <a href="#A8.T21" title="Table 21 ‣ H.3 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-NeXT (LLaMA 3) ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">21</span></a>,
Tab. <a href="#A8.T22" title="Table 22 ‣ H.3 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-NeXT (LLaMA 3) ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a>, and
Tab. <a href="#A8.T23" title="Table 23 ‣ H.3 Sequential tuning detailed performance tables on LLaVA-NeXT (LLaMA 3) ‣ Appendix H Detailed task performance ‣ How To Teach Large Multimodal Models New Skills?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23</span></a> are detailed performance tables of sequentially fine-tuning the Full model, Vision Encoder + Projector, LLM, SA projection layers in LLM, MLP layers in LLM, and MLP (Gate&amp;Up), respectively.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A8.T18" class="ltx_table">
